  "id": "58/G",
  "goal": "Explain how VR rendering maps 3D scenes to displayed pixels and how the graphics pipeline, graphics APIs, layered software, and parallel GPUs influence its computational resource requirements.",
  "achieves": "Prepares the learner to analyze the resource demands of an XR system and later support its optimization and confident implementation."
 },
